  "label": "Hateful Rhetoric Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme falsely attributes hateful and racist rhetoric to Democratic politicians, including Ilhan Omar, Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez, and Ayanna Pressley, claiming they 'hate whites, jews, christians, conservatives, republicans.' This is a harmful stereotype that targets protected characteristics and is used to delegitimize and demonize specific political figures and their ideology. The stereotype relies on the false assumption that political opposition is inherently hateful and racist, which is a common tactic in divisive political discourse.",
